    fallback) through StateHolderModel -> LoadableState. No HTTP in the view.
  * States rendered: loading (skeleton), empty (no-degradation), error (retry, offline copy),
    content, stale chip, offline chip, and the web "more data needed" chart fallback + 1x1
    compact layout. Every branch from the web source reproduced.
  * i18n (P1/S10): all 8 source strings + chrome resolve via Localizable.xcstrings
    (translation.widget.*, widget.freshness.*, translation.queryError.*). No English literals.
  * Charts: Swift Charts AreaMark+LineMark with the 80% RuleMark threshold (web ReferenceLine
    y=80), token palette index 1 (web palette.series[1]).
  * A11y: VoiceOver labels/identifiers on stats, chart, freshness, retry; Dynamic Type + tokens.
  * Telemetry (P1/S11): emits view.opened via SurfaceTelemetry seam mapping to
    TelemetryEvent.ScreenView(screen:"BatteryDegradationTrendWidget"); asserted by spy.

Path/structure adaptation (disclosed; no silent drift):
  * The prompt's nominal path apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/ is not a compiled source
